<title>USA: Ionic Fuel agrees to patent application.</title>
<headline>Ionic Fuel agrees to patent application.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Dela. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionic Fuel Technology Inc said on Wednesday that it agreed to an initial patent application with an undisclosed international oil company for the development of ionizers to reduce coking in process equipment.</p>
<p>The company said that details of the process could not be published until the application has been finalized and formalized by March 1998.</p>
<p>Ionic Fuel Technology is an environmental and combustion technology company.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
